# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scheduled-job scripts in this folder are normally CLI-only, but hosts
# like Hostinger only support triggering cron via a public URL. Web
# access is therefore allowed at the server level; each script enforces
# its own protection by requiring a valid CRON_SECRET_KEY (see
# requireCronSecret() in api/config.php) before doing any work, so
# unauthenticated requests are rejected with 403 by the script itself.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
Require all granted

# Never allow browsing this directory's listing.
Options -Indexes
